                    coach_intro:            `A USD 70 billion rival can lose money in Indonesia for a decade — you cannot. Frost's framework asks two questions of every category: how globalised is the pressure, and how transferable are your assets? Your warungs and local fit are non-transferable; that is precisely why they protect you. Concentrate force where you are decisive, dodge where you are not, refuse the battles you cannot win, and never hand the enemy the key to your moat.`,

